{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/abyssal-exalted/994780-ex2-monsters-of-death-an-abyssal-homebrew","id":994780,"title":"[Ex2] Monsters of Death: an Abyssal homebrew","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Abyssal Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-10-28T13:25:20-07:00","id":994780,"title":"[Ex2] Monsters of Death: an Abyssal homebrew","content":"Over on SV, some people have been brainstorming a better version of Abyssals. The base idea is to create a new version of Abyssals, similar to how TAW was created to be a better version of Lunars. In this version, we'll be attempting to make Abyssals based off the idea of Abyssals as ghost/horror stories.<br /> <br /> Abyssals aren't 'dark solars' they are creatures of the grave, with what that implies. They are ghosts, revenants, mummies, vampires, wights, and all sorts of other monsters. They remain ability based, but each ability is set to make them similar to a kind of ghost story, while staying within the themes of the Ability.<br /> <br /> If you're interested in contributing, go over to the <a href=\"https://discord.gg/rhSAg3m\" target=\"_blank\">discord </a>or the <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1_v_wu8uuJl-5w-u1U2v-FBHN_ERi7XjtYpI1YJDrqQs/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">googledoc</a> and feel free to get started. I'm still getting the doc set up, and plan on starting on the base ideas behind each area today.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6783-notanautomaton","name":"notanautomaton","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"184"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}